    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • South region ranks last in sales (391,722) and orders (1,620) among all 4 regions
        • Tables and Machines sub-categories show critical losses: -4,623 and -1,439 profit respectively
        • Three major states operate at losses: North Carolina (-13.5% margin), Tennessee (-17.4% margin), Florida (-3.8% margin)
        • Combined unprofitable states represent 44.8% of regional sales but generate -16,232 loss

        Recommendations:
        • Immediately review pricing strategy for Tables and Machines or consider discontinuing in South region
        • Conduct state-specific cost analysis for NC, TN, and FL to identify operational inefficiencies
        • Reduce discount rates from current 14.7% average to improve profit margins
